143
00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:40.270
It's Christmas at Dunder Mifflin.

144
00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:43.270
Today is the day of the office holiday party.

145
00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:48.970
The group originally plans to have a secret Santa gift exchange, but when Michael doesn't

146
00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.730
