147
00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:56.890
This causes a multitude of confusion and hurt feelings, and Michael's solution is then to

148
00:04:56.890 --> 00:05:02.210
go out and buy booze, which is against company rules, and to try to get the party back on

149
00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:02.610
track.

150
00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.350
Fifteen bottles of vodka.

151
00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:05.630
That'll do it.

152
00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:08.630
Fastback number one.

153
