161
00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:35.270
A lot of people also asked if we exchanged gifts as a caSt.

162
00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:36.630
Not at the holidays.

163
00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:42.610
We would do what's called a wrap gift, which happens at the end of the season, and we would

164
00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:45.330
