165
00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:45.810
Yeah.

166
00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:49.610
And then the cast would get together, and we'd pool our money, and we would buy the crew.

167
00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:52.110
Every member of the crew would get a gift from the caSt.

168
00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:56.430
And then sometimes cast members would give each other wrap gifts.

169
00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:57.530
Little individual gifts.

170
00:05:57.650 --> 00:05:57.810
Yeah.

171
00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:02.650
I did host a Yankee swap Christmas party, and I did it every year for a few years.

172
00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:04.510
And I actually want to bring it back.

173
00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:09.270
I took a few years off because just, you know, life, kids, and, you know, stuff like that.

174
00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:09.450
Yeah.

175
00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:12.030
But I hosted a Yankee swap party every year.

176
00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:12.810
Oh, yes, you did.

177
00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:16.250
And it was a big party, and everyone would come, and it got so rowdy.

178
00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:16.810
Yeah.

179
00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:21.230
My favorite person to have at a Yankee swap party is Oscar Nunez.

