And we have had a montage with a song, but it's like the song playing in the car.

1793
01:12:42.040 --> 01:12:42.460
Sure.

1794
01:12:42.820 --> 01:12:43.520
Something like that.

1795
01:12:43.520 --> 01:12:46.340
It has to be sound that is, what do they call that?

1796
01:12:46.460 --> 01:12:47.640
Like a live sound.

1797
01:12:47.680 --> 01:12:48.460
Active, a live sound.

1798
01:12:48.460 --> 01:12:48.680
Yeah.

1799
01:12:48.780 --> 01:12:49.380
Something like that.

1800
01:12:49.480 --> 01:12:50.060
Active sound.

1801
01:12:50.380 --> 01:12:50.720
Yeah.

1802
01:12:50.940 --> 01:12:55.760
Before we get to the final scenes of the show, I just wanted to point out two lines that

1803
