We're not.

1810
01:13:20.080 --> 01:13:20.600
We just really think they're good.

1811
01:13:20.740 --> 01:13:21.840
We just really think they're good.

1812
01:13:21.980 --> 01:13:25.600
And you guys, Oscar Nunez is so great with physical comedy.

1813
01:13:26.120 --> 01:13:30.400
I did a sketch show with him before The Office years ago in my 20s.

1814
01:13:30.480 --> 01:13:31.360
We've known each other forever.

1815
01:13:31.740 --> 01:13:36.420
He is a great physical comedian, but he didn't get to do very much of that on The Office.

1816
01:13:36.420 --> 01:13:40.840
But there is a scene in the deleted scenes where him and Creed move a desk, and he gets

1817
01:13:40.840 --> 01:13:45.260
