These episodes are almost harder for me than other ones because there's so much emotion

1974
01:19:08.500 --> 01:19:09.340
attached to it.

1975
01:19:09.460 --> 01:19:11.280
There's so much that happens in the scene.

1976
01:19:11.740 --> 01:19:16.700
Not only, like, is it special to us personally, but it was, like, a big moment for our characters.

1977
01:19:16.980 --> 01:19:17.160
Yeah.

1978
01:19:17.440 --> 01:19:24.400
And just that moment at the end, that snowball fight, that is just a group of people who love

1979
01:19:24.400 --> 01:19:26.760
each other, who are all getting to hang out.

1980
01:19:26.760 --> 01:19:29.340
And we just happened to be on a TV show together.

1981
01:19:29.600 --> 01:19:29.880
Yeah.

1982
01:19:29.880 --> 01:19:31.280
It's just a really special moment.

1983
