1986
01:19:45.320 --> 01:19:46.400
And we are friends.

1987
01:19:46.540 --> 01:19:46.720
Yeah.

1988
01:19:47.100 --> 01:19:47.920
And we're family.

1989
01:19:48.140 --> 01:19:48.580
We are.

1990
01:19:48.960 --> 01:19:52.380
So next week, we've got another big episode, Ange.

1991
01:19:52.380 --> 01:19:53.200
Huge episode.

1992
